 me and inherit from the family of Jacob. And make him, my Lord, pleasing [to You].\"","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":6,"sd":null},{"k":"19:7","t":"[He was told], \"O Zechariah, indeed We give you good tidings of a boy whose name will be John. We have not assigned to any before [this] name.\"","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":7,"sd":null},{"k":"19:8","t":"He said, \"My Lord, how will I have a boy when my wife has been barren and I have reached extreme old age?\"","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":8,"sd":null},{"k":"19:9","t":"[An angel] said, \"Thus [it will be]; your Lord says, 'It is easy for Me, for I created you before, while you were nothing.'\"","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":9,"sd":null},{"k":"19:10","t":"[Zechariah] said, \"My Lord, make for me a sign.\" He said, \"Your sign is that you will not speak to the people for three nights, [being] sound.\"","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":10,"sd":null},{"k":"19:11","t":"So he came out to his people from the prayer chamber and signaled to them to exalt [Allāh] in the morning and afternoon.","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":11,"sd":null}],"juz":16,"hizb":31,"surahs":[19],"sajdah":false}